menu "DriveLink main"

    config DRIVELINK_STACK_LOG_PERIOD_S
        int "Task stack high-water log period (s)"
        default 30
        range 0 3600
        help
            While app_main idles, log the smallest free stack (high-water
            mark, in bytes) of every FreeRTOS task this often. 0 turns the
            log off. Used to size task stacks; needs
            CONFIG_FREERTOS_USE_TRACE_FACILITY (set in sdkconfig.defaults).

endmenu
